1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,078
In this town, every kid gets a fighting power at twelve, and the duke ranks us all.

2
00:00:04,271 --> 00:00:07,769
The baker's kid got hot hands and brags. The captain got thunder fists.

3
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:10,607
Mine's a fake. My fists just glow like lanterns.

4
00:00:10,891 --> 00:00:12,577
Every night, I punched boulders anyway.

5
00:00:12,783 --> 00:00:15,559
Today a stone giant stomped onto my little sister's bridge.

6
00:00:15,747 --> 00:00:17,708
She's five. She hums everywhere.

7
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:19,797
So I ran past the guards. All of them.

8
00:00:20,001 --> 00:00:22,417
My fists lit up. The whole crowd gasped.

9
00:00:22,632 --> 00:00:24,668
"Go home, lantern boy," the captain said.

10
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:25,435
"Make me."

11
00:00:25,632 --> 00:00:29,029
He has the strongest power alive. He shoved me with thunder fists.

12
00:00:29,201 --> 00:00:31,145
His boots slid backward. I didn't move.

13
00:00:31,354 --> 00:00:33,957
The giant swung a boulder. I caught it with one fist.

14
00:00:34,125 --> 00:00:35,958
Yes. It felt as good as you think.

15
00:00:36,151 --> 00:00:38,073
One jump, and I was on the giant's arm.

16
00:00:38,247 --> 00:00:41,102
I hit his rocky arm. It cracked, and he fell in the river.

17
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:44,145
A beam had fallen on my sister. I lifted it like a twig.

18
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:46,574
Then I did the one thing I was never allowed to do.

19
00:00:46,763 --> 00:00:47,641
I hugged her tight.

20
00:00:47,868 --> 00:00:51,087
The duke always said glowing fists burn things. I believed him.

21
00:00:51,278 --> 00:00:52,780
She didn't burn. She laughed.

22
00:00:53,009 --> 00:00:53,825
I looked up at the duke.

23
00:00:53,997 --> 00:00:56,160
He never got a power at all. So what does that make him?

24
00:00:56,506 --> 00:00:58,703
"Arrest him!" he squeaked. Nobody moved.

25
00:00:58,922 --> 00:00:59,910
Here's what the duke missed.

26
00:01:00,077 --> 00:01:02,273
More boulders every night. Never enough.

27
00:01:02,452 --> 00:01:04,884
What happens to a kid who punches a mountain of rock every night?

28
00:01:05,103 --> 00:01:06,789
My fake power never made me strong.

29
00:01:06,945 --> 00:01:07,737
The boulders did.

30
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:10,610
The duke laughed so hard at weak kids that he made a strong one.

31
00:01:10,821 --> 00:01:12,578
And he called half this town's kids fake.

32
00:01:12,817 --> 00:01:14,527
The crowd looked down at their own fists.

33
00:01:14,713 --> 00:01:16,250
Then a badge hit the ground behind me.

34
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:17,828
The captain was throwing his away.

35
00:01:18,002 --> 00:01:19,555
Twenty years. Top rank.

36
00:01:19,728 --> 00:01:21,469
Almost twice as long as I've been alive.

37
00:01:21,706 --> 00:01:23,740
He wasn't looking at me. He was looking at my sister.

38
00:01:23,908 --> 00:01:24,951
And I was still holding her.

39
00:01:25,170 --> 00:01:26,582
What would they call your power?

